			<td style="width: 39.32%; border: none; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="39%">
			<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 11.7pt; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">2. Malaka oshirish boʻyicha oʻquv dasturlarni qayta koʻrib chiqish va takomillashtirish.</span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 10.02%; border: none; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="10%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">2024-yil oktabr</span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 10;">
			<td style="width: 39.32%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="39%">
			<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 11.7pt; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">3. Muhammad al-Xorazmiy nomidagi Toshkent axborot texnologiyalari universiteti huzuridagi Pedagog kadrlarni qayta tayyorlash va ularning malakasini oshirish tarmoq markazi bazasida kriptologiyaga oid fanlardan dars berayotgan professor-oʻqituvchilar uchun sohaning yetuk mutaxassislarini jalb qilgan holda malaka oshirish kurslarini tashkil etish.</span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 10.02%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="10%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Alohida rejaga muvofiq,</span></p>

			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">doimiy</span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 11;">
			<td rowspan="3" style="width: 2.74%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="2%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">4.</span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="3" style="width: 17.98%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="17%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Respublika oliy taʼlim muassasalarining iqtidorli yoshlari oʻrtasida kriptologiya boʻyicha fan olimpiadasini tashkil etish</span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 39.32%; border: none; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="39%">
			<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 11.7pt; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">1. Oliy taʼlim muassasalarining iqtidorli yoshlari oʻrtasida kriptologiya boʻyicha har yili oʻtkaziladigan fan olimpiadasini taʼsis etish va uning nizomini ishlab chiqish.</span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 10.02%; border: none; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="10%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">2024-yil sentabr</span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="3" style="width: 16.34%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="16%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Mazkur maqsadlar uchun ajratilgan budjet va budjetdan tashqari mablagʻlar doirasida</span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="3" style="width: 13.6%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="13%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Oliy taʼlim, fan va innovatsiyalar vazirligi, vazirlik va idoralar (tizimida oliy taʼlim muassasalari mavjud)</span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 12;">
			<td style="width: 39.32%; border: none; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="39%">
			<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 11.7pt; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">2. Kriptologiya boʻyicha fan olimpiadasini oʻtkazish rejasini ishlab chiqish.</span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 10.02%; border: none; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="10%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">2024-yil oktabr</span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 13;">
			<td style="width: 39.32%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="39%">
			<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 11.7pt; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">3. Rejaga muvofiq kriptologiya boʻyicha fan olimpiadasini tashkil etish va oʻtkazish.</span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 10.02%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="10%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Har yili noyabr oyida</span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 14;">
			<td colspan="6" style="width: 100.0%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="100%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">II. KRIPTOLOGIYA SOHASIDAGI ILMIY-TADQIQOTLAR KOʻLAMI VA AMALIY AHAMIYATINI OSHIRISH</span></strong></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 15;">
			<td rowspan="4" style="width: 2.74%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="2%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">5.</span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="4" style="width: 17.98%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="17%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Kriptologiya sohasidagi ilmiy faoliyat natijalarini ommalashtirish</span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 39.32%; border: none; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="39%">
			<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 11.7pt; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">1. Muhammad al-Xorazmiy nomidagi Toshkent axborot texnologiyalari universiteti huzuridagi Radioelektron tizimlar va axborot texnologiyalari markazida axborot xavfsizligi va kiberxavfsizlik, xususan, kriptologiyaning fundamental va amaliy yoʻnalishlari muammolari boʻyicha tayyorlangan ilmiy maqolalarni oʻz ichiga qamrab oluvchi “<em style="mso-bidi-font-style: normal;">Axborot xavfsizligi muammolari</em>” ilmiy jurnalini taʼsis etish, tahrir hayʼati va uning ish tartibi haqidagi nizom hamda nashriyot ishini moliyalashtirish tartibini belgilovchi idoraviy hujjatni ishlab chiqish.</span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 10.02%; border: none; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="10%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">2024-yil sentabr</span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="4" style="width: 16.34%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="16%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Mazkur maqsadlar uchun ajratilgan budjet va budjetdan tashqari mablagʻlar doirasida</span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="4" style="width: 13.6%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="13%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Raqamli texnologiyalar vazirligi,</span></p>

			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Oliy taʼlim, fan va innovatsiyalar vazirligi,</span></p>

			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Fanlar akademiyasi,</span></p>

			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Davlat xavfsizlik xizmati</span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 16;">
			<td style="width: 39.32%; border: none; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="39%">
			<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 11.7pt; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">2. “Axborot xavfsizligi muammolari” ilmiy jurnalining muntazam faoliyat olib borishini taʼminlash hamda Oliy taʼlim, fan va innovatsiyalar vazirligi huzuridagi Oliy attestatsiya komissiyasining dissertatsiyalar asosiy ilmiy natijalarini chop etish tavsiya etilgan ilmiy nashrlar roʻyxatiga kiritish.</span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 10.02%; border: none; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="10%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">2024-yil dekabr</span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 17;">
			<td style="width: 39.32%; border: none; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="39%">
			<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 11.7pt; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">3. Estafeta tartibida tegishli muassasalarda axborot xavfsizligi va kiberxavfsizlik, xususan kriptologiyaning fundamental va amaliy yoʻnalishlari muammolarini muhokama qilish boʻyicha oʻtkaziladigan “<em style="mso-bidi-font-style: normal;">CyberCryptUz</em>” ilmiy-texnik konferensiyasini taʼsis etish, tahrir hayʼati va uning ish tartibi haqidagi nizom hamda konferensiya ishi va materiallarini nashr etishni moliyalashtirish tartibini belgilovchi hujjatni ishlab chiqish.</span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 10.02%; border: none; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="10%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">2025-yil aprel</span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 18;">
			<td style="width: 39.32%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="39%">
			<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 11.7pt; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">4. <em style="mso-bidi-font-style: normal;">“CyberCryptUz”</em> respublika ilmiy-texnik konferensiyasining muntazam tashkil etilishini taʼminlash.</span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 10.02%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="10%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Har yili oktabr oyida</span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 19;">
			<td rowspan="2" style="width: 2.74%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="2%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">6.</span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="width: 17.98%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="17%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Fanlar akademiyasi tizimida kriptologiya muammolarini tadqiq etish bilan shugʻullanuvchi ilmiy tuzilmani tashkil etish choralarini koʻrish</span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 39.32%; border: none; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="39%">
			<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 11.7pt; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">1. Fanlar akademiyasi tizimida kriptologiyaning matematik, fizik va texnik muammolarini tadqiq etish bilan shugʻullanuvchi ilmiy tuzilmalar va laboratoriyalarni tashkil etish boʻyicha xorijiy tajribani oʻrganish.</span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 10.02%; border: none; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="10%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">2024-yil sentabr</span></p>
			</td>
