			<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: center;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Moliyalashtirish talab etilmaydi</span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="width: 13.6%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="13%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Fanlar akademiyasi</span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 20;">
			<td style="width: 39.32%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="39%">
			<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 11.7pt; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">2. Fanlar akademiyasi tizimida kriptologiya muammolarini tadqiq etuvchi tuzilmalar va laboratoriyalarni tashkil etish boʻyicha tegishli hujjat loyihasini ishlab chiqish.</span></p>

			<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 11.7pt; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Bunda, “Kvant axboroti”, “Kvant kriptografiyasi” va boshqa shu yoʻnalishlarda ilmiy tadqiqotlarni amalga oshirishni nazarda tutish.</span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 10.02%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="10%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">2024-yil oktabr</span></p>
			</td>
