			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Oʻzbekiston Milliy universitetida kriptologiya fanini yanada rivojlantirish choralarini koʻrish</span></p>
			</td>
