			<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: center;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Moliyalashtirish talab etilmaydi</span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="width: 13.6%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="13%">
			<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Oliy taʼlim, fan va innovatsiyalar vazirligi</span></p>
