		<tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 22; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;">
			<td style="width: 39.32%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" valign="top" width="39%">
			<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 11.7pt; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">2. Oʻzbekiston milliy universiteti tarkibida kriptologiya yoʻnalishi boʻyicha oʻquv va ilmiy tuzilmalar tashkil etishga oid tegishli hujjat loyihasini ishlab chiqish.</span></p>

			<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 11.7pt; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Bunda, “Kvant axboroti”, “Kvant kompyuteri”, “Postkvant kriptografiyasi”, “Kriptotahlil” va boshqa shu yoʻnalishlarda ilmiy tadqiqotlar va taʼlim jarayonlarini amalga oshirishni nazarda tutish.</span></p>
