<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" width="2%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">T/r</span></b></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" width="16%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ilmiy loyiha mavzusi</span></b></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" width="35%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Amalga oshirish mexanizmi, kutilayotgan natijalar</span></b></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" width="13%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Loyihani bajarish muddati</span></b></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" width="17%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Masʼul ijrochilar</span></b></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" width="15%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Loyihani moliyalashtirish hajmi<sup><a href="javascript:scrollText(-7069342)">*</a></sup></span></b></p></td></tr>
<tr>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="2%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1.</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="16%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Kriptografiya fani boʻyicha elektron oʻquv qoʻllanma yaratish</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="35%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 11.55pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Respublika va chet el ilgʻor tajribasini oʻrganish asosida qoʻllanma tarkibi va mazmuni boʻyicha talablarni ishlab chiqish.</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 11.55pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Tanlov asosida zamonaviy kriptografiyaning asosiy masalalari va instrumentlarini mujassam etgan elektron oʻquv qoʻllanmani yaratish.</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 11.55pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Qoʻllanmani uslubiy ishlanmalarga qoʻyilgan talablarga mosligini tekshirish, virtual platformalarda sinovdan oʻtkazish, axborot xavfsizligi yoʻnalishidagi malakaviy talablarga muvofiqligi va samaradorligi boʻyicha baholash.</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="13%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2024 — 2028-yillar davomida, oʻtkaziladigan tanlovga muvofiq</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="17%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Oliy taʼlim, fan va innovatsiyalar vazirligi,</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Fanlar akademiyasi,</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Raqamli texnologiyalar vazirligi,</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Davlat xavfsizlik xizmati,</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">manfaatdor vazirlik va idoralar</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="15%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1 719 317 958 soʻm</span></b></p></td></tr>
<tr>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="2%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2.</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="16%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Kriptotahlil fani boʻyicha elektron oʻquv qoʻllanma yaratish</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="35%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 11.55pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Respublika va chet el ilgʻor tajribasini oʻrganish asosida qoʻllanma tarkibi va mazmuni boʻyicha talablarni ishlab chiqish.</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 11.55pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Tanlov asosida zamonaviy kriptotahlilning asosiy masalalari va instrumentlarini mujassam etgan elektron oʻquv qoʻllanmani yaratish.</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 11.55pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Qoʻllanmani uslubiy ishlanmalarga qoʻyilgan tegishli talablarga mosligini tekshirish, virtual platformalarda sinovdan oʻtkazish, axborot xavfsizligi yoʻnalishidagi malakaviy talablarga muvofiqligi va samaradorligi boʻyicha baholash.</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="13%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2024 — 2028-yillar davomida, oʻtkaziladigan tanlovga muvofiq</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="17%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Oliy taʼlim, fan va innovatsiyalar vazirligi,</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Fanlar akademiyasi,</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Raqamli texnologiyalar vazirligi,</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Davlat xavfsizlik xizmati,</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">manfaatdor vazirlik va idoralar</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="15%">
