<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="16%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Katta razryadli tub sonlarni ishlab chiqish algoritmlarini yaratish</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="35%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 11.55pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Respublika va chet el ilgʻor tajribasini oʻrganish asosida yaratiladigan algoritm uchun texnik topshiriq va talablarni ishlab chiqish.</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 11.55pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Tanlov asosida katta razryadli tub sonlarni ishlab chiqish va tublikka tekshirishning yangi algoritmlarini yaratish.</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 11.55pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Algoritmlarni zamonaviy kriptografik talablar boʻyicha tekshirish, ishlash tezligi, dasturiy va apparat-dasturiy realizatsiyasini sinovdan oʻtkazish, samaradorligini baholash.</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 11.55pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Algoritmlar uchun zamonaviy dasturlash tillarida kutubxonalar ishlab chiqish.</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="13%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2024 — 2028-yillar davomida, oʻtkaziladigan tanlovga muvofiq</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="17%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Oliy taʼlim, fan va innovatsiyalar vazirligi,</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Fanlar akademiyasi,</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Raqamli texnologiyalar vazirligi,</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Davlat xavfsizlik xizmati,</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">manfaatdor vazirlik va idoralar</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="15%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1 719 317 958 soʻm</span></b></p></td></tr>
<tr>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="2%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">14.</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="16%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Obyektni autentifikatsiya qilish protokollarini yaratish</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="35%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 11.55pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Respublika va chet el ilgʻor tajribasini oʻrganish asosida yaratiladigan protokol uchun texnik topshiriq va talablarni ishlab chiqish.</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 11.55pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Tanlov asosida obyektni autentifikatsiya qilishning zamonaviy yondashuvlarga asoslangan protokollarini yaratish.</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 11.55pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Protokollarni zamonaviy kriptografik talablar boʻyicha tekshirish va kriptografik bardoshliligini baholash, ishlash tezligi, dasturiy va apparat-dasturiy realizatsiyasini sinovdan oʻtkazish.</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 11.55pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Yaratilgan protokollar uchun zamonaviy dasturlash tillarida kutubxonalar ishlab chiqish.</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="13%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2024 — 2028-yillar davomida, oʻtkaziladigan tanlovga muvofiq</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="17%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Oliy taʼlim, fan va innovatsiyalar vazirligi,</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Fanlar akademiyasi,</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Raqamli texnologiyalar vazirligi,</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Davlat xavfsizlik xizmati,</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">manfaatdor vazirlik va idoralar</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="15%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1 719 317 958 soʻm</span></b></p></td></tr>
<tr>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="2%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">15.</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="16%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Zamonaviy kriptotahlil usullarini yaratish</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="35%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 11.55pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Respublika va chet el ilgʻor tajribasini oʻrganish asosida yaratiladigan kriptotahlil usullariga talablarni ishlab chiqish.</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 11.55pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Tanlov asosida zamonaviy kriptografik algoritmlarning kriptobardoshliligini baholash va tahlil qilishning yangi usullarini yaratish.</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 11.55pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Yaratilgan usullar orqali kriptografik algoritmlarni baholash murakkabliklari boʻyicha tajriba-sinovlarini oʻtkazish, ularning samaradorligini baholash</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 11.55pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Yaratilgan usullar uchun dasturiy taʼminotlar ishlab chiqish.</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="13%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2024 — 2028-yillar davomida, oʻtkaziladigan tanlovga muvofiq</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="17%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Oliy taʼlim, fan va innovatsiyalar vazirligi,</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Fanlar akademiyasi,</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Raqamli texnologiyalar vazirligi,</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Davlat xavfsizlik xizmati,</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">manfaatdor vazirlik va idoralar</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="15%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1 719 317 958 soʻm</span></b></p></td></tr>
<tr>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0cm" valign="top" width="2%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"></p></td>
